# `sign_data`

In [`std/crypto`](index.hmd).

```hql
fn sign_data<A : Signing>(self: Data, key: PrivateKey<A>) : Bytes
```

The signature of `canonical(self)`, the RFC 8785 text of the tree, so
two trees equal under HQL equality have one signature.
<!-- hql reference: end -->
